Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.91,0:15:08.67,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.22,0:15:11.22,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.01,0:15:14.69,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好灵活的身手！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.95,0:15:17.08,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,毕竟是Wing做的小鸟呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.38,0:15:19.03,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,讨厌 诶嘿嘿嘿...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.19,0:15:20.92,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不是脸红的时候啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.09,0:15:22.07,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.23,0:15:23.56,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.44,0:15:33.24,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,双色合一！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.65,0:15:34.61,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,白色！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.65,0:15:34.61,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}White！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.30,0:15:37.29,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝色！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.30,0:15:37.29,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Blue！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.19,0:15:44.01,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,温度的力量 给你降降温！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.22,0:15:47.54,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.07,0:15:51.07,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,融合调色盘还有那种功能吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.31,0:15:52.53,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,花样还多着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.95,0:15:54.69,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,现在行了... 呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.63,0:15:56.49,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,拉拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.64,0:15:57.65,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,成了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.87,0:15:59.09,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,趁机接着打！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.45,0:16:02.47,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.19,0:16:06.46,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱... 暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.62,0:16:07.59,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.98,0:16:10.20,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,明明都冻住了 为什么还能飞
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.69,0:16:14.11,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是上升气流
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.62,0:16:19.34,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴兽乘着向天空而上的气流
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.76,0:16:22.80,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,这样啊 Wing也一样能够办到吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.85,0:16:25.15,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我试试看！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.66,0:16:26.74,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.44,0:16:33.69,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.21,0:16:34.93,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.68,0:16:47.53,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,Butterfly 对着云使用刚才的降温能力！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.31,0:16:50.46,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,不是对着乱暴兽 而是对着云？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.03,0:16:54.75,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,温度的力量 给你降降温！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.71,0:17:06.95,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱！暴...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.48,0:17:08.50,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,冰... 冰块？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.77,0:17:10.26,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么一回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.68,0:17:15.45,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,云本来就是很小的水滴或者冰晶集合而成的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.10,0:17:20.83,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,用降温的能力来冷却云 让冰晶变大
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.27,0:17:24.27,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,融合调色盘还能实现这种效果啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.67,0:17:26.52,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,花样还多着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.47,0:17:29.60,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,整什么花活...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.77,0:17:34.32,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你那种花样 看我用大力来破 乱暴兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.73,0:17:37.46,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.71,0:17:45.49,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,这也太猛了...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.45,0:17:50.26,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才乱暴兽的飞行 是乘着上升气流...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.16,0:17:53.18,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,对了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.65,0:17:54.45,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Wing！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.66,0:17:55.95,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,休想！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.71,0:17:58.68,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,中计了呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.92,0:18:03.96,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,强风只要撞上山 就会产生强烈的上升气流！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.08,0:18:08.15,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.33,0:18:09.43,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,什么...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.70,0:18:13.09,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,不... 不如说一对一来得好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.37,0:18:14.53,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.71,0:18:15.95,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.61,0:18:20.74,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,哇...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.69,0:18:27.97,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,只靠着Precure的力量 是无法飞到这么高的...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.37,0:18:32.02,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,没有白费啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.55,0:18:34.85,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.01,0:18:36.13,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,哇...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.14,0:18:39.47,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.15,0:18:43.28,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,拉拉...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.62,0:18:47.77,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.20,0:18:50.12,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,Butterfly
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.31,0:18:51.81,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,要飞扬起来了 Wing！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.41,0:18:53.53,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.97,0:18:57.01,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,全色合一！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.30,0:18:58.64,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,融合调色盘！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.30,0:18:58.64,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Mix Palette！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.08,0:18:59.92,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,红色！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.08,0:18:59.92,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Red！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.78,0:19:02.94,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,黄色！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.78,0:19:02.94,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Yellow！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.38,0:19:05.57,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝色！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.38,0:19:05.57,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Blue！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.08,0:19:08.35,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,白色！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.08,0:19:08.35,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}White！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.93,0:19:15.81,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,搅拌搅拌
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.98,0:19:17.49,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,色彩填充！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.98,0:19:17.49,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Colour Charge！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.09,0:19:41.38,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,光美·绚烂彩虹冲击！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.09,0:19:41.38,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Precure Titanic Rainbow Attack！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.10,0:19:48.45,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,豁然开朗
Dialogue: 1,0:19:46.10,0:19:48.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}豁然开朗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.92,0:19:54.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,魔镜平板！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.92,0:19:54.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Mirrorpad！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.42,0:20:02.46,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,OK！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.84,0:20:09.27,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嘁！搞什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.44,0:20:12.81,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你们能得瑟的日子也就剩今天了 我可是说真的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.71,0:20:17.41,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哼... 似乎到了使用那个的时候了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.90,0:20:19.44,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,虚蜢蜢！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.58,0:20:27.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an7}{\fs50}《有治疗效果的花草世界》《矿石详解》《解惑宇宙天梯图鉴》《观星天文学》
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.97,0:20:29.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按照阿翼弟弟的委托 我带来了各种不同内容的书
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.85,0:20:31.22,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.96,0:20:35.64,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然 我现在还没有大伙那样具体的梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.24,0:20:40.00,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我想先学习一下各种不同的学问
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.07,0:20:43.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 我觉得很不错
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.18,0:20:48.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有一样东西 希望你能够收下...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.91,0:20:50.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.11,0:20:52.12,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.28,0:20:53.05,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.21,0:20:54.48,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,真的可以吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.01,0:21:01.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个魔镜平板能够协助你\N\N将求知心连接起来 扩展开来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.94,0:21:06.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿翼弟弟使用的话 就能够成为大家强有力的后盾
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.45,0:21:08.57,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.63,0:21:10.59,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.26,0:21:12.68,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.02,0:21:16.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.38,0:21:18.54,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,那么我们吃晚饭吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.81,0:21:22.04,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,今天吃夏季蔬菜多多的自家咖喱！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.51,0:21:23.42,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,咖喱！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.57,0:21:24.77,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,卡里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.99,0:21:29.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,白天吃了油咖喱 现在口味都是咖喱的口味了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.69,0:21:32.88,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 我也知道一点咖喱的知识哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.44,0:21:34.63,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.94,0:21:39.67,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,咖喱饭不是咖辣饭 甜口的咖喱也很好吃！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.94,0:21:39.67,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}请回顾第8集
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.21,0:21:42.04,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈... 是啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.35,0:21:44.54,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 我喜欢吃中辣的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.84,0:21:47.76,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,甜口和中辣 都做吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.19,0:21:50.49,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我都要吃！全都要吃！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.87,0:21:53.92,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,把... 把我那份给留下啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.95,0:21:59.47,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊呜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.67,0:22:09.07,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Blossom！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.67,0:22:09.07,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1075,970)}绽放愈卫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.67,0:22:12.80,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,和我一起 让心之花绽放吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.37,0:23:49.08,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝天大地那边传来了新的情报？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.25,0:23:53.48,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,莉虹莓队员来电说 有飒拉拉队长的目击情报
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.66,0:23:54.93,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 小晴！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.14,0:23:57.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,队长 我相信你不会出事的！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.07,0:24:00.48,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.07,0:24:00.48,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海阔天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.58,0:24:03.09,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,虚蜢达 最后的秘策！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.27,0:01:19.48,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（冲上蓝天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.48,0:01:25.07,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 超越云巅
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.28,0:01:30.62,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飞吧！向着海阔天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.62,0:01:38.33,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空万里 美丽蓝天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.53,0:01:43.45,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨后初霁天空棱镜折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.75,0:01:47.71,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝天的景色预告着有好事发生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.71,0:01:49.22,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（蓝天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.22,0:01:53.52,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要确认一下 便伸直了双手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.10,0:01:58.10,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名为希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.19,0:02:00.06,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速紧握！紧紧握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.19,0:02:04.65,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,战胜绝望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.03,0:02:08.60,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.60,0:02:11.99,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦干眼泪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.64,0:02:11.99,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已经做好准备了吗）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.99,0:02:14.04,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飞跃而起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.39,0:02:14.04,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(让我们张开勇气之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.37,0:02:19.75,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 朝气蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.96,0:02:24.42,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把烦躁化为光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.62,0:02:29.72,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未来的图景 充满着可能
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.89,0:02:34.47,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,与在同一片蓝天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.85,0:02:37.27,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起唤起通向明日的奇迹！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.39,0:02:45.27,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海阔天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.12,0:22:29.79,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了!! 晴空万里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.77,0:22:34.36,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是能实现梦想与心愿的蔚蓝
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.52,0:22:37.11,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,打开心中的麦克风
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.11,0:22:38.94,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,轻轻哼唱起！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.94,0:22:41.32,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,希望的旋律♪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.78,0:22:44.24,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}今天心情愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.24,0:22:46.20,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}如果能与你分享
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.20,0:22:48.87,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,就能打开心灵+门扉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.95,0:22:51.66,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}稍等片刻！我已经激动到势不可挡!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.66,0:22:53.33,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}笑容也在合唱！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.46,0:22:56.00,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧☆我的好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.15,0:23:02.57,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}还是那条街 {\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}就像平日里
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.28,0:23:08.39,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都在那里 这便是奇迹啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.39,0:23:10.74,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的宝贝！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.45,0:23:15.12,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都过来！传开这韵律
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.12,0:23:19.38,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,手牵起手 心连起心
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.38,0:23:25.45,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,用温暖的关怀 培育出的勇气 是无穷无穷的∞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.55,0:23:29.72,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,积极的图标是标记
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.72,0:23:33.89,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,想要更了解！这海阔天空的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.89,0:23:37.59,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们展开翅膀 飞向蓝天
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.59,0:23:38.98,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,连接起人与人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.98,0:23:41.69,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure 笑容的圆环！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
